  "title": "Vertiv Introduces Liquid Cooling Drop-In Retrofit Solution for Data Centers",
  "summary": "Vertiv today introduced the Liebert® XDU, a thermal management system that supports an entire cabinet of liquid-cooled servers and enables drop-in retrofits in air-cooled data centers. The Liebert XDU enables the deployment of liquid cooled server applications into any data center environment. The system is available currently in North America.",
